  "summary": "ACCEPT. The complete current exact-owner plan is aligned with the unchanged Story 12.5 specification, approved Sprint Change Proposal, corrected PRD/August architecture, Constitution I-V, Ubiquitous Language, and the unchanged Story 12.4 owner lookup. PR-EO-001 is closed by required server-only SymbolName propagation through claimed hydration, PreparedPass1WorkerPacket, PreparedPass1JobRunner.CreateDispatchRequest, PreparedPass1FileCodeUnitAssignment, dispatcher and executor, with repeated v1/v2 reconstruction and explicit provider-shape exclusion. PR-EO-002 is closed by owning a dedicated textDocument/documentSymbol parser that reads real LSP kinds and carries explicit hierarchy provenance while preserving unrelated navigation. PR-EO-003 is closed in accordance with the official LSP 3.18 contract: only homogeneous array-root DocumentSymbol evidence can authorize a top-level owner; mandatory range and selectionRange are validated with containment, children remain hierarchical, and flat SymbolInformation coordinates never gain hierarchy authority or use containerName for inference. PR-EO-004 is closed by explicitly owning and testing the sole hydrated-packet-to-assignment bridge in PreparedPass1JobRunner, including semantic-v2 and path-v1 round trips plus omission/mutation rejection before executor/provider continuation. The versioned identity is feasible in existing columns; persistence, replay, handoff, source re-fetch, dispatch and Source Anchor flow are testable; long-running Git/JDT-LS/CodeGraph/XML/Worker work stays outside database transactions; and no migration, public input, prompt/tool/provider schema, job policy, generic/nonmatching Scan, CGC, Track A/B, or Story 12.4 change is planned. No unresolved placeholder, authority contradiction, Critical/High finding, or Constitution MUST violation remains. Because AD-PSI-7 materially changes matched-profile JDT-LS document-symbol handling, File Code Unit identity, and internal Prepared Pass 1 propagation, the AGENTS.md Scan planned-change trigger remains active: the orchestrator must now pause for explicit scope-bound authorization before task generation or production implementation. The unrelated user-owned .env.example and immutable attempt-01/02 verdict files were excluded from authored ownership; reviewed-path git diff --check passed."
